          "Prompt": {
            "prompt": "I would like to opne discussion about an issue that I have in my local development machine. This is Ubuntu 24.04.4 LTS. For simplicity I opted to install Docker Desktop and not regular installation. Can you explain the differences between the two instalations in networking aspect?"
          }
